---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { business } from '../data/business';
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';
import { BUILD_DATE } from '../lib/schema';

const updated = new Date(BUILD_DATE).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
  day: 'numeric',
  month: 'long',
  year: 'numeric',
});
const { currencySymbol } = business.rates;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy & Terms | Yong's Tutoring"
  description="How Yong's Tutoring collects and uses your data, the cookies and analytics we use, and the terms that apply to our online tutoring services."
  path="/privacy/"
>
  <section class="section section--petrol">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy &amp; Terms</h1>
      <p class="lede" style="color: var(--stone);">
        How we handle your information, and the terms that apply when you use
        Yong's Tutoring. Last updated <time datetime={BUILD_DATE}>{updated}</time>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap legal-body">
      <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>

      <h3>Who we are</h3>
      <p>
        Yong's Tutoring provides online, one-to-one tutoring. If you have any
        question about your data, contact us at
        {' '}<a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h3>What we collect</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Enquiry details.</strong> When you use our contact form or email
          us, we receive the name, email address and any message or details you
          choose to send, so we can reply and arrange lessons.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Analytics.</strong> We use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which is
          privacy-first and does not use cookies or track you across sites, and AI
          Rank Lab, which helps us understand how the site is found. These tell us
          things like page views and general location, not who you are.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Technical logs.</strong> Our host and content network (GitHub
          Pages and Cloudflare) process standard technical data such as IP address
          and browser type to deliver the site securely.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3>How we use it</h3>
      <p>
        We use your information only to respond to your enquiry, arrange and provide
        tutoring, and to understand and improve the website. We do not sell your
        data, and we do not use it for advertising.
      </p>

      <h3>Who we share it with</h3>
      <p>
        We use a small number of trusted providers to run the site and receive
        enquiries: Formspree (delivers contact-form messages to us), Cloudflare and
        GitHub Pages (hosting, security and analytics), and AI Rank Lab (search
        analytics). Each processes data only to provide their service to us.
      </p>

      <h3>Cookies</h3>
      <p>
        Cloudflare Web Analytics is cookieless. Some providers, including AI Rank
        Lab, may use cookies or similar technologies to measure usage. You can
        block or delete cookies in your browser settings; the site will still work.
      </p>

      <h3>Keeping your data</h3>
      <p>
        We keep enquiry emails for as long as needed to respond and, where you
        become a student, to provide tutoring. You can ask us to delete them at any
        time.
      </p>

      <h3>Your rights</h3>
      <p>
        You can ask to see, correct or delete the personal information we hold about
        you. Email {' '}<a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a> and
        we will action your request.
      </p>

      <h3>Students under 18</h3>
      <p>
        Many of our students are under 18. Where that is the case, we ask that a
        parent or guardian makes or approves the enquiry and any lesson
        arrangements.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-terms">Terms of Service</h2>

      <h3>Our services</h3>
      <p>
        We provide online, one-to-one tutoring for GCSE and A-level students, and
        interview preparation, in the subjects listed on this site. Lessons are
        delivered over video and arranged individually with each student.
      </p>

      <h3>Pricing and payment</h3>
      <p>
        Our standard rates are {currencySymbol}{business.rates.gcse} per hour for
        GCSE, {currencySymbol}{business.rates.alevel} per hour for A-level and
        {' '}{currencySymbol}{business.rates.interview} per hour for interview
        preparation. Rates may change over time; the price for your lessons is
        agreed with you before they begin. Payment and scheduling are arranged
        directly with you.
      </p>

      <h3>Cancellations</h3>
      <p>
        If you need to cancel or reschedule a lesson, let us know as early as you
        can and we will do our best to accommodate you. Any specific arrangements
        are agreed between us when lessons are booked.
      </p>

      <h3>What we can and cannot promise</h3>
      <p>
        We work hard to help every student improve, but we cannot guarantee a
        specific grade or exam outcome, as results depend on many factors including
        each student's own effort.
      </p>

      <h3>Content</h3>
      <p>
        The content of this website belongs to Yong's Tutoring and is provided for
        information only.
      </p>

      <h3>Contact</h3>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms or your privacy? Email
        {' '}<a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a> or message
        {' '}<a href={business.whatsappHref}>{business.phoneDisplay} on WhatsApp</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-body {
    max-width: 46rem;
  }

  .legal-body h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .legal-body h2.legal-terms {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 2.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }

  .legal-body h3 {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    color: var(--petrol);
    font-size: 1.12rem;
  }

  .legal-body p,
  .legal-body li {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .legal-body ul {
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-body strong {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
</style>
